#: src/lib/subedit/gui/transcribe_dialog.cpp
msgid ""
"Choose the language of the speech. \"Detect\" lets the model find it from "
"the first 30 seconds of sound, which a film that opens with music can get "
"wrong."
msgstr ""
"Selecte li lingue del parol. “Detecter” lassa li model trovar it del prim 30 "
"secondes de son, quo un film quel comensa con musica posse far mal."

#: src/lib/subedit/gui/transcribe_dialog.cpp
msgid ""
"A time as HH:MM:SS, for example 00:02:00. Leave both empty to transcribe the "
"whole film."
msgstr ""
"Un témpor in li formate HH:MM:SS, por exemple 00:02:00. Lassar ambi vacui "
"por transcrir li tot film."

#: src/lib/subedit/gui/transcribe_dialog.cpp
msgid ""
"The audio of the film open in this window is transcribed into subtitles that "
"replace the ones of the project. The work runs in the background and can be "
"cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Li audio del film aperit in ti fenestre es transcrit in subtitules quel "
"remplazza ti del projecte. Li labor funde in li fon e posse esser anullat."

