msgstr "Proposit del lingue quel li file declara por ti-ci pista."

#: src/lib/subedit/gui/transcribe_dialog.cpp
msgid ""
"The file declares no language for this track: the model will detect it from "
"the first 30 seconds of sound. If the film opens with music or silence it "
"can choose wrongly, and the speech is then translated into that language. "
"Choose the language if you know it."
msgstr ""
"Li file declara null lingue por ti pista: li model detectará it del prim 30 "
"secondes de son. Si li film comensa con musica o silentie it posse errar, e "
"li parlada es tande tradutet in ti lingue. Selecte li lingue si vu save it."

