#~ "Leave it empty to let the model detect the language from the first 30 "
#~ "seconds of sound."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Un code de lingue quam fr, en, de, es o it (fra e eng functiona anc). "
#~ "Lassa it vacui por que li model detecte li lingue del prim 30 secondes de "
#~ "son."

#~ msgid "estimating the time left…"
#~ msgstr "estimation del témpor restant…"

#~ msgid "This model cannot detect the language: type it."
#~ msgstr "Ti model ne save detecter li lingue: scri it."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The file declares no language for this track: the model will detect it "
#~ "from the sound. Type it if you know it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Li file declara null lingue por ti-ci pista: li model detectará it del "
#~ "son. Scri it si vu save it."

